{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Beach Vacation Simulator, the cutting-edge simulator that offers an unparalleled experience of tranquility. Immerse yourself in a virtual paradise where your only priority is to take in the sights and sounds of the waves and wind brushing against the beach. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are gamers getting headshot in the room next door. <strong>But not you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <br>The paladin in that streamer's party really wants that shield to drop and has to run that dungeon over a 100 times. <strong>Not you.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Your family is locked into the TV for the news waiting with bated breath over what is going to happen tomorrow. <i><strong>Not you.</strong></i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496790/extras/0a2348c21709fef20e3eee10bf0d943f.poster.avif?t=1758519153\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496790/extras/0a2348c21709fef20e3eee10bf0d943f.webm?t=1758519153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496790/extras/0a2348c21709fef20e3eee10bf0d943f.mp4?t=1758519153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's all good. Just take a deep breath in. Look at the waves. Hear them crash. And let that deep breath out.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2496790?t=1758519153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2496